  {
    "number": 84,
    "html_url": "https://github.com/festflow-club/festflow/pull/84",
    "title": "feat(auth): migrate auth from Firebase to Supabase",
    "user": {
      "login": "meera-k",
      "id": 81234011,
      "type": "User",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/meera-k"
    },
    "state": "closed",
    "draft": false,
    "merged": true,
    "merged_at": "2026-03-12T11:28:00Z",
    "closed_at": "2026-03-12T11:28:00Z",
    "created_at": "2026-03-12T08:32:00Z",
    "base": {
      "ref": "main"
    },
    "head": {
      "ref": "supabase-auth"
    },
    "labels": [
      {
        "name": "auth"
      },
      {
        "name": "P0"
      }
    ],
    "body": "## Why\n\nFirebase free tier hit limits during fest sign-ups: the daily email-link quota ran out on 9 and 11 March and about 200 people were stuck on the \"check your inbox\" screen. Upgrading to the Blaze plan needs a credit card the club does not have.\n\n## What\n\n- Supabase Auth (magic link + Google) replaces Firebase Authentication\n- API verifies Supabase JWTs (`SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET`) instead of Firebase ID tokens\n- `scripts/import-firebase-users.ts` imports existing users by email\n- Firebase project stays read-only until May, then we delete it\n\n## Testing\n\nTested Google sign-in and magic link locally and on a Render preview.\n\nCloses #14",
    "review_comments": [
      {
        "id": 1640008400,
        "user": {
          "login": "arjun-mehta",
          "id": 90455120,
          "type": "User",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/arjun-mehta"
        },
        "created_at": "2026-03-12T09:50:00Z",
        "body": "Tested locally, Google and magic link both work. Should we delete the Firebase project now?"
      },
      {
        "id": 1640008401,
        "user": {
          "login": "meera-k",
          "id": 81234011,
          "type": "User",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/meera-k"
        },
        "created_at": "2026-03-12T10:11:00Z",
        "body": "Not before May, in case we need to look up old uids."
      },
      {
        "id": 1640008402,
        "user": {
          "login": "arjun-mehta",
          "id": 90455120,
          "type": "User",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/arjun-mehta"
        },
        "created_at": "2026-03-12T10:40:00Z",
        "body": "LGTM, approving."
      }
    ]
  },
